<title>USA: Goldman wins $60 mln University of Maryland System.</title>
<headline>Goldman wins $60 mln University of Maryland System.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said it won $60 million of University of Maryland System auxiliary facility and tuition revenue bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.128 percent.</p>
</text>
